:"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1609442062,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNjA5NDQyMDYy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:shaders","name":"topic:shaders","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-07-15T03:14:57Z","updated_at":"2025-11-29T03:31:30Z","closed_at":"2025-07-25T01:57:13Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108620","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108620","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108620.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108620.patch","merged_at":"2025-07-25T01:57:13Z"},"body":"Great work @Geometror on improving the Visual Shader Editor's state persistence - this [PR](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/666d7c030bb0d898f607df8c62f8f2bc6282ffd6) did introduce two minor issues that this PR fixes.\r\n\r\n**Issue 1:** Creating a Visual Shader of type Particle, Sky or Fog creates a broken Output node with no values.\r\n<img width=\"1180\" height=\"640\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-07-14 at 8 05 15 PM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3f5e6e99-a46a-4240-83fe-b6c2e34f4156\" />\r\n**Steps to recreate:** New project, create a new Sky Visual Shader, view in Visual Shader Editor.\r\n\r\n**Issue 2:** Loading a Particle Visual Shader can fail to restore state and throw an 'Out of Bounds' error in the console.\r\n<img width=\"723\" height=\"114\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-07-14 at 8 07 33 PM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/782a0fd0-d86d-4078-baf0-42dfecc33fce\" />\r\n**Steps to recreate:** New Project, create a new Particle Visual Shader, view in Editor and swap type to \"Process\". Close project, reopen project. \r\n\r\n**Cause:** \r\n\r\n```\r\nint saved_type = vs_editor_cache->get_value(id_string, \"edited_type\", 0);\r\nedit_type->select(saved_type);\r\nset_current_shader_type((VisualShader::Type)saved_type);\r\n```\r\n\r\nUsing 0 as the default value for 'Saved Type' causes the output nodes to display incorrectly for Sky/Fog/Particle shaders because 0 represents a type for Spatial or Canvas shaders only. Because this value is then immediately saved to the config, and may not be able to be changed by the user, this breaks Visual Sky & Fog shaders.\r\n\r\nUsing Saved_Type (which should be an integer representing a value of the Types enum from Visual_Shader.h) for edit_type->select (which expects an index representing an options button) can cause an out of bounds selection, and restore an incorrect state.\r\n\r\nThe code in this PR adds back extra logic to set defaults correctly, and pass appropriate values to the two functions.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108620/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108620/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}